  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Par 207.03 Appearance and Representation. If the parolee is represented by counsel, the counsel shall file an appearance that includes the following information:\n\n(a) A brief identification of the matter;\n\n(b) A statement as to whether the attorney is licensed to practice in New Hampshire; and\n\n(c) The attorney’s daytime address and telephone number.\n\nSource. #7149, eff 12-7-99, EXPIRED: 12-7-07\n\nNew. #9070, INTERIM, eff 1-11-08, EXPIRED: 7-9-08\n\nNew. #9254, eff 9-6-08; ss by #12157, eff 4-7-17",
